      "deviation": "runtime-memstats",
      "note": "Counts allocations recorded through testing::record_alloc (alloc_stats). Installing a counting GlobalAlloc needs unsafe, which the root crate forbids, so a program that wants real counts installs its own allocator calling record_alloc; without one the result is 0."
    },
